  "label": {
    "en": [
      "This is a vintage postcard addressed to Dr. Benito Pérez Galdós, Villa San Quintín, in Santander, Jardines. The card has a handwritten address and a stamp postmarked from Biarritz, which is visible in the upper right corner. The main printed text reads 'CARTE POSTALE' and additional French text explaining exclusivity for the address. 'Espagne' is handwritten in the upper left corner."
    ]
